### 2. Test Coverage Audit for Terminal Container Geometry

Inspected test suites:
- `ui/src/components/TerminalPane.test.tsx`
- `ui/src/lib/terminalHostManager.test.ts`
- `ui/src/lib/terminalHostManager.output.test.ts`
- `ui/src/lib/terminalHostManager.lru.test.ts`
